    {
      "kind": "source",
      "text": "Several higher-level replicators can arrive at the same R port with different current levels. The port applies the same local adjustment to each. With delta +3, level 7 becomes 10 and level 12 becomes 15.",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000215"
      ],
